{"seq":1,"slug":"atp-ctp-definition-boundaries","title":"ATP 与 CTP 的定义、承诺语义与边界划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/atp-ctp-definition-boundaries","wordCount":2856,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"atp-与-ctp-的定义-承诺语义与边界划分\">ATP 与 CTP 的定义、承诺语义与边界划分</h1><p>一个买家在结算页看到「预计 10 月 14 日送达」时，他看到的不是一句话，而是一份带置信度的<strong>单边契约</strong>：平台承诺在那个日期前交出那个数量，并为此占据了某处库存或产生了某条补货计划。造出这句承诺的机器就是订单承诺引擎，而它内部被追问最多的一对概念，是 ATP（Available-to-Promise，可承诺量）与 CTP（Capable-to-Promise，能力可承诺量）。本篇拆开这两个词的<strong>定义、承诺语义、以及各自不能越过的边界</strong>——跨境电商里大量「超卖」「迟到」「拆单」事故，根因不是算力不够，而是把 ATP 当成了 CTP，或把承诺当成了一个纯数字。本册目录见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-承诺是一条带置信度的契约-不是一个库存数\">核心概念：承诺是一条带置信度的契约，不是一个库存数</h2><p>行业文献给出的 ATP 定义很克制：它是「一种依据资源可用性回应客户订单询问的业务功能」，会<strong>生成可承诺的可用数量以及交付到期日</strong>（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Available to promise</em>）。这里有两个关键词——<strong>数量</strong>和<strong>到期日</strong>——它们是承诺的两条腿，缺一条承诺就是残缺的。只报「有货」不报「哪天到」，等于把交期风险转嫁给买家；只报日期不报「能承诺几件」，等于在数量上留了暗账。</p>\n<p>定义同时区分两种驱动方式：<strong>推式（push-based）</strong> 由需求预测（如主生产计划 MPS）算出可承诺量与日期，弱点是依赖预测精度；<strong>拉式（pull-based）</strong> 在订单到来时动态分配资源，但容易短视。执行上又分<strong>实时</strong>与<strong>批处理</strong>（来源：同上）。跨境电商的结算页承诺几乎全是实时或近实时，这正是工程难度的来源。</p>\n<p>CTP 是对 ATP 的<strong>扩展</strong>：ATP 回答「现有的、已在计划中的供给能承诺什么」，CTP 回答「如果<strong>再生产、再采购、再调拨</strong>，在产能、供应商与提前期约束下还能承诺什么」（来源：Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM, <em>Global Order Promising</em>，其文档将 ATP 与 CTP 并列为 GOP 的两种承诺模式）。一句话总结边界：<strong>ATP 承诺的是存量与在途，CTP 承诺的是能力。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[买家请求:要什么、要多少、想哪天到] --&gt; B{承诺引擎选模式}&#10;    B --&gt;|有现成可用供给| C[ATP 模式]&#10;    B --&gt;|需触发新供给| D[CTP 模式]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[净算现有库存 + 在途]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[扣除占用/分配/安全库存]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[评估产能/供应商/运输能力]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[生成计划供给并回填交期]&#10;    C2 --&gt; E[输出承诺:量 + 日 + 源 + 置信度]&#10;    D2 --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{置信度是否达标}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[硬承诺:占用库存/生成预留]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[软承诺:仅估计,可被抢单]&#10;    G --&gt; I[回写订单/结算页]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[买家请求:要什么、要多少、想哪天到] --&gt; B{承诺引擎选模式}\n    B --&gt;|有现成可用供给| C[ATP 模式]\n    B --&gt;|需触发新供给| D[CTP 模式]\n    C --&gt; C1[净算现有库存 + 在途]\n    C --&gt; C2[扣除占用/分配/安全库存]\n    D --&gt; D1[评估产能/供应商/运输能力]\n    D --&gt; D2[生成计划供给并回填交期]\n    C2 --&gt; E[输出承诺:量 + 日 + 源 + 置信度]\n    D2 --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{置信度是否达标}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[硬承诺:占用库存/生成预留]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[软承诺:仅估计,可被抢单]\n    G --&gt; I[回写订单/结算页]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>这张图的工程含义是：<strong>承诺输出的是一个四元组，而不是一个数</strong>。任何把承诺降维成一个 <code>availableQty</code> 字段的实现，都会在后续的拆单、改址、取消、跨仓调拨里丢失重新决策所需的全部信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺语义的四要素-量-日-源-置信度\">承诺语义的四要素：量、日、源、置信度</h2><p>把承诺建模成契约，至少要显式承载四个维度，缺任何一个都会在异常场景里退化成「靠猜」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n<th>典型载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>量（Quantity）</strong></td>\n<td>本次承诺交付的数量，可小于请求量（部分承诺）</td>\n<td>无法表达部分可满足，只能全给或全拒</td>\n<td><code>promisedQty</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>日（Date）</strong></td>\n<td>承诺交付的<strong>责任日</strong>，不是「预计日」</td>\n<td>买家看到的是营销日期而非履约义务</td>\n<td><code>promiseDate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>源（Source）</strong></td>\n<td>承诺由哪个仓/供应商/运输通道兑现</td>\n<td>无法追溯、无法重算、无法对账</td>\n<td><code>sourceNodeId</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>置信度（Confidence）</strong></td>\n<td>该承诺是硬占用还是软估计</td>\n<td>多单并发时同一份库存被承诺多次</td>\n<td><code>hard | soft</code> + 版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ATP 的<strong>输入</strong>是库存、计划收货（生产订单、采购订单等计划收入）、以及计划需求（销售订单、交货单、预留等计划消耗）（来源：Wikipedia, <em>Available to promise</em>，其示例取自 SAP）。跨境电商把这组输入<strong>跨仓、跨境、跨承运商</strong>拉长了一层：计划收货还来自海外仓补货、在途海运、以及保税区待清关的货。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>请求日</strong>：买家想哪天到。</li>\n<li><strong>可承诺日</strong>：系统<strong>有能力且愿意负责</strong>哪天到——这才是契约。</li>\n<li><strong>预计日</strong>：基于统计的乐观估计，无占用、无责任。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结算页应展示可承诺日而非预计日：把预计日当承诺日，是「迟到投诉」最常见的技术成因，它没有被任何库存或产能背书。</p>\n<p>「置信度」决定并发安全。硬承诺必须在承诺时<strong>原子地</strong>占用对应供给（预留、分配或生成计划单），否则两个买家可以在毫秒间读到同一份 <code>availableQty</code> 并各自拿到硬承诺。软承诺只写估计值、不占用，允许被更高优先级订单抢占，但必须能<strong>被推翻并重算</strong>并通知到买家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"atp-的净算边界-供给-需求-分配与安全库存\">ATP 的净算边界：供给、需求、分配与安全库存</h2><p>ATP 不是「库存查询」，而是一次<strong>净算</strong>，把同一时间窗内的供给与消耗相抵，再扣掉为已在途承诺预留的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>Supply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>Demand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP(t) = \\text{OnHand} + \\sum_{\\tau \\le t}\\text{Supply}(\\tau) - \\sum_{\\tau \\le t}\\text{Demand}(\\tau) - SS - Alloc(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Supply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Demand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">OnHand</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是可用现存量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Supply(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 时点确认的计划收货（采购、调拨、生产、退货返库），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Demand(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是已确认的需求（已承诺订单、预留、内部消耗），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是安全库存，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Alloc(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>产品分配（product allocation）</strong> 或跨渠道/跨客户的配额扣减。</p>\n<p>这个式子里藏着跨境电商特有的复杂度：<strong>多仓可承诺</strong>。买家下单时并不指定仓库，承诺引擎必须在候选仓之间做<strong>寻源（sourcing）</strong>，而每个仓的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ATP(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与到买家的<strong>运输提前期</strong>都不同，于是「同一数量在不同仓的承诺日不同」。可承诺量因此不是标量，而是**（仓 × 日期）的二维矩阵**，寻源在矩阵上求解「最早能兑现请求量的 (仓, 日) 组合」。这也解释了为什么跨境承诺容易退化成「乐观日」——寻源规则一旦缺失或过期，引擎只能退回取某个默认仓的粗略估计。</p>\n<p>必须强调的边界：<strong>ATP 不产生新供给。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_t ATP(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 仍小于请求量时，ATP 只能返回部分承诺或无承诺，任何「先答应再补」的做法都已经越界到 CTP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ctp-把产能与提前期纳入承诺\">CTP：把产能与提前期纳入承诺</h2><p>CTP 的定义要点是：它把<strong>额外供给能否在能力和提前期内被生产、采购或调拨出来</strong>纳入判断，而 ATP 只看已经存在或已经排定的供给（来源：Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM, <em>Global Order Promising</em>）。形式上，CTP 在 ATP 之上叠加一个<strong>能力可行域</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>Cap</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>Material</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CTP(t) = ATP(t) + \\sum_{r \\in R}\\min\\!\\Big(\\text{Cap}_r\\big(t_{start}(r),\\, t\\big),\\ \\text{Material}_r(t)\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Material</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是可动用的资源集合（产线、供应商产能、承运商舱位、海外仓分拣能力），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cap</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cap}_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 从启动时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{start}(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到承诺日 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 窗口内的可用能力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Material</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Material}_r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Material</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是所需物料/库存的可得性——<strong>两者取小</strong>，缺任一都无法兑现。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{start}(r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 由提前期反推，这决定了 CTP 的搜索方向是<strong>从交期倒推</strong>而非从库存正推。</p>\n<p>跨境的 CTP 里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 中权重最大的几项往往不是工厂产能，而是<strong>运输能力与清关能力</strong>：海运舱位、空运腹舱、口岸清关时窗都可能成为瓶颈。成熟的能力可承诺实现会把承运商舱位与清关时效纳入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Cap</mtext><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cap}_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——优化的对象是<strong>约束下的承诺日</strong>，不是库存数字。</p>\n<p>CTP 的工程代价有三：<strong>计算更重</strong>（约束求解里搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>资源</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>提前期</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(资源, 提前期)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资源</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提前期</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 组合，无法靠一次区间查询完成）、<strong>确定性更低</strong>（产能与舱位是概率性的）、<strong>责任更重</strong>（覆盖链路更长更易中断）。因此实践原则是：<strong>能用 ATP 兑现的绝不升级到 CTP；必须用 CTP 的，默认输出软承诺，并只在其计划单落库后转为硬承诺。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"边界划分-atp-不是分配-不是预留-不是需求计划\">边界划分：ATP 不是分配、不是预留、不是需求计划</h2><p>把承诺引擎放进整套系统里，需要划清它与四个相邻概念的边界，否则职责互相渗透，最终谁都不对承诺负责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与承诺的关系</th>\n<th>越界后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>需求计划（forecast/MPS）</strong></td>\n<td>未来<strong>应该</strong>需要多少</td>\n<td>是 ATP 的<strong>输入</strong>之一（推式）</td>\n<td>把预测当承诺，超卖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>分配（allocation）</strong></td>\n<td>某渠道<strong>最多</strong>能拿多少</td>\n<td>是 ATP 的<strong>扣减项</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Alloc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>把配额当可售量，渠道间抢货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预留（reservation）</strong></td>\n<td>某订单<strong>已占用</strong>多少</td>\n<td>是<strong>硬承诺的落地动作</strong></td>\n<td>预留与可售口径不一致，账实不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>承诺（promise）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>现在</strong>能对这笔订单承诺什么</td>\n<td>本主题</td>\n<td>与上面三者混为一谈，责任不清</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条边界判据可以快速自查：<strong>预测 ≠ 承诺</strong>——预测给出的「期望」没有被任何库存或产能背书，承诺必须能指认它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sourceNodeId</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 与占用凭证，凡是「先看预测说有货就答应」的实现都在制造超卖；<strong>分配 ≠ 可售量</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Alloc</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oc</span></span></span></span></span> 是策略性冻结，是可售量的减项而非本身，把配额当对外承诺上限会低估真实能力，忽略配额则侵占受保护供给；<strong>预留 ≠ 承诺</strong>——预留是承诺兑现后对供给的占用记录，二者必须口径一致、可对账，承诺说 100、预留只写 80，差额就是未来的对账缺口。</p>\n<p>还有一条跨系统边界：<strong>承诺引擎负责「能否、何时」，不负责「怎么发」。</strong> 拆单、寻源执行、承运商选择、报关放行属于履约域；承诺只输出四元组并保证其可回溯，被要求「顺手决定拆几个包裹」时就退化成了执行器，重算能力随之丧失。</p>\n<p>SAP 把可用性检查、缺货处理、发货释放、供给保护、替代方案确认打包成 advanced ATP（来源：SAP Help Portal, <em>advanced ATP</em>），恰恰说明这些边界在成熟产品里是<strong>分开配置</strong>的：可用性检查只回答可承诺量，缺货处理在供给不足时重排优先级，发货释放负责临近发货时的二次确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ATP 是净算，不是查询。</strong> 它把现存、在途、已确认需求、安全库存与分配相抵，输出的是**（仓 × 日期）矩阵**而非单一数字。</li>\n<li><strong>CTP 是能力的承诺。</strong> 它在 ATP 之上叠加产能、供应商与运输/清关约束，代价是更重的计算与更低的确定性。</li>\n<li><strong>承诺是四元组：量、日、源、置信度。</strong> 缺任一维，系统都会在并发、拆单、改址、取消时丢失重算依据。</li>\n<li><strong>三种日期不可混用。</strong> 对外展示必须落在可承诺日上，而非请求日或预计日。</li>\n<li><strong>硬承诺必须原子占用，软承诺必须可被推翻并通知。</strong> 这是并发安全的下限。</li>\n<li><strong>边界纪律：预测不是承诺，分配不是可售量，预留必须与承诺同口径。</strong> 承诺引擎只决定「能否、何时」，不决定「怎么发」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Wikipedia, <em>Available to promise</em>（ATP 定义、推/拉式、实时/批处理、SAP 输入示例）；SAP Help Portal, <em>advanced ATP</em>（可用性检查、缺货处理、发货释放、供给保护、替代方案确认）；Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM, <em>Global Order Promising</em>（ATP 与 CTP 承诺模式及其差异）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ATP 与 CTP 的定义、承诺语义与边界划分","id":"atp-与-ctp-的定义-承诺语义与边界划分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：承诺是一条带置信度的契约，不是一个库存数","id":"核心概念-承诺是一条带置信度的契约-不是一个库存数"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺语义的四要素：量、日、源、置信度","id":"承诺语义的四要素-量-日-源-置信度"},{"level":2,"text":"ATP 的净算边界：供给、需求、分配与安全库存","id":"atp-的净算边界-供给-需求-分配与安全库存"},{"level":2,"text":"CTP：把产能与提前期纳入承诺","id":"ctp-把产能与提前期纳入承诺"},{"level":2,"text":"边界划分：ATP 不是分配、不是预留、不是需求计划","id":"边界划分-atp-不是分配-不是预留-不是需求计划"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"交期承诺计算模型：承诺日期、可用日期与 SLA 层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-date-computation-model"}}